Vendored Source
================================================================================

This distribution redistributes third-party source code in the following
locations. These are not Rust crate dependencies and therefore do not appear
in the SBOM.

- crates/tflite-sys/litert/
    LiteRT C API headers
    Copyright 2024-2025 Google LLC
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
    Source: https://github.com/google-ai-edge/LiteRT (tag v2.1.6)
    License text: crates/tflite-sys/litert/LICENSE
    Local modifications: crates/tflite-sys/litert/patches/

    These headers are used solely as bindgen input to generate FFI type
    definitions; they are not compiled or linked into the resulting binaries.

